@segment  campfire-presence
@title    Astral Campfire — Group Presence
@levels   F15
@shelved  source session removed by user on 2026-08-22
@duration ~32m

say Now that the fire burns steadily, sit with it. You have made yourself visible. You are here.
pause 6
say Simply wait.
pause 8
say If contact comes, you will feel it. Not as a thought, but as a presence. It will draw your attention in a way you cannot ignore.
pause 6
say Like a shout without volume. Like a single footstep in silence. It may feel like a tension in the space, a weight that wasn't there before.
pause 8
say You may sense where it comes from, just as you know where a sound originates even when you cannot see it.
pause 6
say This is not about imagining, or trying to know. It is about noticing what arrives on its own.
pause 6
say Rest here, with the fire before you, until the experience feels complete.
hold 1800
